  "subject": "a man stuck on hold with his bank's hotline for an hour, the same hold tune looping and the recorded voice telling him his call is important",
  "caption": "Cantonese lounge punk. Fast down-picked overdriven guitar, a cheesy lounge Farfisa organ playing elevator-music melodies over punk drums, an electric bass jumping between a walking line and eighth-note punk, snappy drums that suddenly drop into brushed lounge-bossa breaks. Raw garage-room recording, organ slightly out of tune, abrupt tempo flips. A sardonic male tenor talk-singing the verses and shouting the chorus with a group backing. 172 BPM, D major. Exasperated, deadpan and comic. No pop-punk polish, no autotune, no EDM, no trap beat, no metal growls.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n廣東話請按一 英文請按二\n查詢結餘請按三 我想搵真人\n我按咗零字 佢話請稍候\n你嘅來電 對我哋好重要\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n然後又係 嗰首音樂\n叮叮噹噹 好似𨋢入面\n\n[Chorus]\n請按零字 我按到手指都扁\n一個鐘 佢都未聽\n請按零字 首歌唱咗六十遍\n我識得哼 我仲識得和音\n\n[Verse]\n我煮咗個麵 我晾埋衫\n電話擺喺 檯面開住擴音\n阿媽問我 做乜跳舞\n我話銀行 請我聽緊演唱會\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n忽然停咗 我企直咗\n點知佢話 你嘅來電好重要\n\n[Chorus]\n請按零字 我按到手指都扁\n一個鐘 佢都未聽\n請按零字 首歌唱咗七十遍\n我諗住 報名去做佢哋伴奏\n\n[Bridge]\n喂 喂 你好 係真人呀\n你好 我想問張卡\n\n[Chorus]\n請按零字 終於有人聽\n佢話唔該 你等一等\n我未講完 佢已經轉線\n又係嗰首歌 又係一個鐘\n\n[Outro]\n你嘅來電 對我哋好重要",
